cctv-viewer (0.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added user avatar and username@hostname display in sidebar header
  * Added company logo (Astral Node Labs) above Collapse button
  * Changed expanded panel header color to burgundy (#5c1d37)
  * Added Recordings panel with Review button to launch Chromium browser
  * Added ProcessLauncher helper for launching external applications
  * Added SystemInfo helper for system user information
  * Enhanced viewport status overlays with icons and live log textbox
  * Improved circular avatar cropping with OpacityMask

