cctv-viewer (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Multi-surface video distribution - shared decoders for duplicate streams
  * Custom aspect ratio support with press-and-hold editing
  * Edit mode protection for kiosk deployment
  * Sidebar UX improvements (disabled control styling, auto-collapse timer)
  * Fixed demo URL initialization to only run on first launch
  * Added systemd service for 24/7 operation

